    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FANNING'S FAB FIFTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fanning's Fab Fifty is a list that ranked the album Giant Steps by The Boo Radleys as #1 for that year."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0153-00ae5a2824c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIC MAGAZINE&quot;">
